Perpetua's continuing PPO implementation adapts PureJaxRL's PPO reference:
https://github.com/luchris429/purejaxrl/blob/31756b197773a52db763fdbe6d635e4b46522a73/purejaxrl/ppo.py

Copyright 2023 Chris Lu. Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0.
See LICENSE-PureJaxRL, distributed alongside this notice.

Modifications: continuing lifetime interface and GAE; removal of episodic
resets, done masks, offline episode logs and finite-budget learning-rate
annealing; keyed action masks; active-slot weighting; numeric PPO state with
exact update clocks; bounded rollout chunks; health checks; configuration and
full-state checkpoint integration; shared PPO optimization for host-controlled
CPU simulator rollouts. Uses JAX categorical primitives instead
of adding Distrax/gymnax wrapper dependencies.

